<title>BELGIUM: Belgian liquidity little changed at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgian liquidity little changed at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank left liquidity little changed at its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date Sept 25	expiry on Oct 2    NBVC</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	    9.6   bln bfr    ( 9.525 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	9.6   bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  100</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on Sept 25</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810</p>
</text>
